e":"2026-11-02T09:33:21.534Z","message.seq":2200,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvppako1eetr0"}},{"message.content":"@守白 你用 API 创建的吧？你试试用 AI 助手的写入功能创建项目和任务看看？好用不","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-02T08:40:59.474Z","message.seq":2201,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"@陈明辉 @高耳机 ai助手有一波多语言，方便的话帮忙上传一下到pre/prod环境吧，我刚从tolgee下载的包，传到【错误码】分类下","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_1044041032","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T06:10:59.73Z","message.seq":2202,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvppako1eetr0"}},{"message.content":"@SuChen 对，因为现在还没openAPI所以先用我自己的token和现在空间任务的http接口，这周自定义字段上线完我是想试一下基于这个项目的数据自动生成一些报告给士衡。之前用的JIRA的AI助手","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-02T08:48:09.596Z","message.seq":2203,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvjhgphs7fnzd"}},{"message.content":"@爱德 ai助手有一波的多语言发布到pre了，可以看看有没有遗漏的","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_1044041032","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T07:22:01.697Z","message.seq":2205,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvppako1eetr0"}},{"message.content":"@陈理仕 swarm环境，有“ai助手权限”控制吗（管理台以及对应的查询接口）","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T03:52:21.124Z","message.seq":2213,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvgomnvjyywac"}},{"message.content":"我用 AI 创建完任务之后，不能立即在任务列表里看到，目前是怎么个刷新机制？","message.content_type":"text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T04:23:09.892Z","message.seq":2214,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"做个小迭代吧，可以比 AI 助手一期晚1-2个版本再上线，@Lexia 你负责","message.content_type":"at_text","message.conversation_id":"sg_3981594831","message.send_time":"2026-11-03T04:56:38.673Z","message.seq":2234,"resources":[],"sender":{"id":"ouvkmtuntg5xpk"}},{"message.content":"AI 助手支持自定义字段，读和写都支持，不过不急，11 月中旬之前出方案就行",